{"server":"tw","storyId":"act28side_level_act28side_07_beg","groupId":"act28side","stageId":"act28side_07","title":"白熱","storyCode":"CV-7","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act28side/level_act28side_07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"50b63b35ffb29997201c147bd6fc11f306dff16eb37476138a9b05591b4299e0","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"新年已過，但達維鎮的風雪依然冰冷刺骨，不帶一絲暖意。\n站在地塊外等車的人群中間，邁爾斯迷迷糊糊地想，在寒風裡等車，似乎是很久以前的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺子，你們要去的拓荒地，到底是個什麼樣的地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……至少應該比達維鎮暖和。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別替我擔心了，他們至少還算留了點情面，讓我能和老鄰居們埋在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉……抱歉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，既然一切都已經改變不了了，不如想想別的事情，別鑽這個牛角尖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如，我剛剛想起來，上次這麼等車，還是去別的移動城市給我小妹妹奔喪那次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是這麼冷的天，海倫娜、伍德洛、里昂，三個人陪我一起等車隊來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我拿著海倫娜餐廳花瓶裡的花束，披著里昂借我的舊禮服，凍了好幾個小時。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說來也怪，我連等車那天伍德洛鬍子多長都記得清清楚楚，可上了車之後，一切都模模糊糊的，好像隔著一層毛玻璃似的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我好像去了很大的移動城市，又覺得那裡還沒達維鎮大；我好像哭了一場，又好像沒哭出來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再之後，就只剩我從回達維鎮的車上下來，他們把我扶下車的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之後的事我反而又都能記起來了，我去海倫娜那裡喝了不少酒，醉得很厲害，連那天晚上的醉話我還記得一清二楚……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車隊首領","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"往拓荒地去的車隊到了！達維鎮的人，開始上車了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“我最疼的小妹妹也沒了，從此之後，我就和達維鎮綁死在一起了，媽的。”\n“里昂，聽見了嗎，我要在地塊上老死！到那時候……”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g3_diner"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邁爾斯，別以為我記不住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說：“到那時候，麻煩你把我推進動力爐裡，我倒要看看自己的骨灰……能不能嗆得達維鎮……打個噴嚏……”"},{"type":"narration","text":"工程師仰起頭，又往嘴裡灌了一大口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛說完，達維鎮還沒怎麼樣，我先打了個驚天動地的噴嚏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，哈哈哈……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當年誰也沒笑，誰都笑不出來，可我現在覺得這事真他媽滑稽，你不覺得嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別不說話呀！喝，邁爾斯，喝！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉……我們來遲了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍德洛先生，海倫娜女士……里昂先生呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們臨出門之前，他說自己只需要一些時間，想通了會過來的……說完就又給自己開了一瓶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……可我們哪還有時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，這對他……或許也算好事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶，這鬼天氣……怎麼就這麼冷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等上了車，你就可以和這裡的鬼天氣說再見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍德洛先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他沒說錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，潔西卡，你真的不用再道歉了。這件事情銀行有錯，黑鋼有錯，就連我們也有不對的地方，唯獨你……你沒做錯任何事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，別自責了，畢竟我們從一開始，就不指望你能做到什麼——"},{"type":"narration","text":"邁爾斯立刻意識到自己的失言，他剛想解釋什麼，可車隊首領已經拉住了他的手臂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車隊首領","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老頭，有什麼話也不該留到現在才說，就差你一個了，趕緊上車！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"潔西卡，我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車隊首領","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再拖下去，在荒地上遇見鏽錘或者天災什麼的，到時候你負責嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車隊首領","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"走了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"潔西卡，你別誤會，邁爾斯他不是這個意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道……可他說得沒錯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我或許是做了很多事，但最後……什麼都沒做成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……什麼都沒改變。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g3_diner"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰呀？伍德洛嗎？海倫娜嗎？別催了，我都說我想通了，我這不是要去送邁爾斯了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼是你？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，怎麼，你是來趕我的嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"西爾維婭並未像里昂習慣的那樣，道歉，低頭，跑走。\n她在原地站了一會兒，手緊緊攥著胸前的什麼東西，然後僵硬地邁開腿，往餐廳裡走去。\n她一直走到餐檯旁邊的座位處，背對著餐館門口坐下，眼睛直勾勾地看著前方的空座。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾維婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里昂先生，伍德洛先生和海倫娜女士……他們還回來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍德洛……海倫娜？跟你有什麼關係？他們送邁爾斯去了——"},{"type":"narration","text":"冷風從西爾維婭剛剛打開的門縫裡鑽進餐廳，嗚咽著掠過空酒瓶的瓶口。\n里昂打了個冷顫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們送邁爾斯去了，等一下就回來，但沒人想找你，能聽懂嗎？能聽懂就趕緊出去，讓我……一個人靜靜。"},{"type":"narration","text":"西爾維婭的十指在桌上緊緊扣在一起。\n她咽了口口水，強迫自己轉過頭，注視里昂的臉，而里昂看見了她經常緊緊攥著的是什麼東西。\n一枚戒指，銀色的，上面有幾顆零零星星的碎鑽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾維婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里昂先生，我不能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你脖子上掛著的戒指是誰給你的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾維婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戒指？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能是我，不可能是本尼……只可能是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……他？"},{"type":"narration","text":"兩人目光相接。\n西爾維婭微微點了點頭，重新攥緊了戒指，眼中顯出某種近乎瘋狂的堅定。\n看著西爾維婭的眼睛，里昂回憶起卡爾的眼神。\n他在出發前頭天晚上消失了幾個小時，回來的時候，眼神和自己面前這個人一模一樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g10_blacksteelarmory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"潔西卡，你也知道……我們小隊一旦接到命令就要撤出達維鎮。不管地塊上發生了什麼，我們都得回本艦去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，我知道……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要走了，邁爾斯先生已經走了，伍德洛先生和海倫娜女士也說會走，里昂先生也不太可能繼續留下……大家都要走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我……我為大家做了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……就算連你自己都不認同，我還是要說，你在達維鎮外圍清理了混混，幫里昂保住了他的房子，讓克里夫先生知道了銀行越權的事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……可到最後，一切都是徒勞，我……我辜負了所有人的期望……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者更糟，就像邁爾斯先生說的那樣……從一開始，就沒人在我身上期望什麼，全是我自己自作多情……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"潔西卡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，就算是自作多情，我也……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅拉，我想出去逛逛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在不是時候，我們馬上就要回本艦了……我去幫你打包行李，你好好睡一覺，好了我來叫你，行嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我得出去散散心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你確定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早點回來，好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……盡量。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g3_diner"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里昂，別喝了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——等等，你酒醒了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那……西爾維婭呢，她有什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她要等你們回來，跟我們三個一起說。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"西爾維婭從座位上站起身，戒指被她攥得很緊。白皙的手上，青色的血管清晰可見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾維婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海倫娜女士，伍德洛先生，里昂先生……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾維婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾維婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道……銀行裡面有一筆錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"銀行裡面永遠都有錢，西爾維婭，這不用你說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾維婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是說……黑鋼給銀行送來了一大筆庫存資金，正鎖在銀行的……保險庫裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾維婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"銀行要為達維鎮的新居民做準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾維婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們清空整個地塊，就是為了迎接那些和新產業配套的精密技工、研發人員、管理人員……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾維婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了滿足他們的存貸款需求，現在銀行裡的錢……比平常多得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾維婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多到……甚至可以讓許多人在拓荒地……重新開始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾維婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……就是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是這樣？西爾維婭，你到底什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……里昂，如果你的酒醒了，你就不會問這種話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我們不能不問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果西爾維婭想的事情真的和我猜的一樣，就更不能不問了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西爾維婭小姐，請問，你是否想要我們把那筆錢還給它們真正的主人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是否想要我們把那筆錢……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搶出來？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"西爾維婭以幾乎難以辨認的幅度微微點了點頭，然後用手摸了摸著胸前的戒指，開始等待審判的降臨。\n餐廳裡一片死寂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……至少現在大家在想同一件事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里昂，你贊成，還是反對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說句話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我……我知道這筆錢是我們的，可……我也不想變成和那幫混混一樣為非作歹的混蛋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"達維鎮為非作歹最多的混蛋從來都不是那些混混。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你是贊成西爾維婭的了，伍德洛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“不”？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我讚賞西爾維婭的勇氣，同時覺得我們沒有勝算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如說，西爾維婭，你有銀行的地圖嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾維婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾維婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我拿不出紙質地圖，但我知道，從銀行大門口到整棟樓的總開關，要走一百步，按我的步幅是六十一米……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾維婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中間要拐三次彎，分別在四十四步、七十四步、九十三步處，標誌物是盆栽、落地燈、櫃臺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾維婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從總開關到保險庫入口要經過會客室，過一扇暗門，下一個三十六級的樓梯，下樓梯後是一條直路，中間的步數分別是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西爾維婭……你……難道你把這些東西硬背下來了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西爾維婭，從你的座位到餐廳門口有多遠？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾維婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛剛走了十八步，在第六步之後向右拐了一個直角彎。總長約十一米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不是硬背……她只是像這樣，走了無數遍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍德洛，你現在覺得我們有幾成勝算？算上你呢？算上里昂呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我們怎麼把錢送到拓荒地，又怎麼抹去這筆錢的蹤跡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這件事我來做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信你能在荒地上活下來，可那筆錢……？"},{"type":"narration","text":"海倫娜嘆了口氣。她輕巧地翻進吧檯，拿起桌上的餐刀，彎下腰撬動地板。\n吱嘎，吱嘎……\n嘣。\n她腳下騰起一團歷史悠久的灰塵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要以為能在屋子漏水的時候找到那個箱子就算徹底了解我了，伍迪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個給我留下餐廳，留下存摺的傢伙——知道我是什麼時候遇到他的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我洗耳恭聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十八歲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時我父親正極力把我推銷給他頂頭上司的兒子，好讓他的職位更上一層樓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得知消息後跑去酒吧待了一整晚，在那裡認識了他……最後，我們騎著他的馱獸狂奔一夜，離開了那個讓我窒息的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你十八歲和他私奔，可你來這裡的時候已經……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們分開了，有二十多年沒見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這二十多年裡，我一直獨自生活在拓荒地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們以為，這些年過去，我連怎麼在荒地上攥緊自己口袋裡的金券都沒學會嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"海倫娜露出一個甜美的笑容，卸下肩上的武器，放在西爾維婭面前的桌上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們不願意加入，我會自己去做這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就憑你和西爾維婭……搶銀行？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可能會在保險庫外面被抓住，可能被困死在錢堆裡，也可能會死在逃跑的路上……反正，只要我還在喘氣，我就要把這件事完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是我的態度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，我需要你們兩個人表態了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"里昂從腰間抽出一把扳手，放在海倫娜的武器旁邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該你了，伍德洛——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"潔西卡？這個時候……你來做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我必須去做……必須做到些什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你還在想今早邁爾斯對你說的話，我的建議是別放在心上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還有大把的時間和精力去做到很多事情，沒必要把自己綁死在達維鎮，或者幾個日薄西山的老傢伙身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，伍德洛先生……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經太多次了，我滿懷熱情，最終卻因為各式各樣的原因……能力不足，時間不夠，情況有變，或者“命令”和“要求”……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就連現在，我都不知道自己能做到什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只能眼睜睜地看著你們被趕走，趕去前途未卜的拓荒地……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再不做到什麼事情，我大概……真的會適應這樣一事無成的日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我甚至能猜到那時候的自己，為了自己心裡的平衡，相信自己能力不足，相信自己本來就保護不了任何人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信自己從一開始舉著銃就沒什麼特別的意義，不過就是一條選錯了，卻又走得太遠，已經無法回頭的路罷了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想那樣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是死，我都不想那樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾維婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西爾維婭小姐？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾維婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果現在就是你最後的一次機會……我們向銀行討回自己東西的最後機會……潔西卡，你還會幫我們嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"西爾維婭一站起來，潔西卡才看到她的臉。\n她整張臉白得嚇人，臉頰處卻不自然地泛著紅色，更襯得其他部分慘白的觸目驚心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍德洛先生？為什麼用銃對著我？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"忘掉你看到和聽到的一切，離開這裡吧，潔西卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這到底是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾維婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要去銀行……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西爾維婭——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾維婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……把原本屬於達維鎮的東西奪回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……奪回來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"潔西卡，回去吧，回到你的朋友身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍德洛先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只是來找我們哭訴了一場，我們給你端上了一杯熱水，拍了拍你的肩膀，就是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還年輕，你的每一天都還是新的，真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"彷彿淚水被凍結乾燥了似的，潔西卡的視線一下子清晰起來。\n她看到西爾維婭臉上異常的紅暈，看到桌上的扳手和陌生的武器，看到伍德洛黑洞洞的銃口。\n她平生第一次在一個瞬間內做出決定。\n她迎著伍德洛的銃口走了過去，走到西爾維婭身邊，把腰間的銃抽出來，放在她的面前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算我一個。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
